# **The config goes with the tests it configures** ([B-108](../docs/BUGS.md)).
#
# `tests/` was excluded because a production image has no business shipping
# tests — correct. `playwright.config.ts` lives at the root because that is
# where Playwright looks for it — also correct. And `tsconfig` type-checks
# `**/*.ts` — correct again. **Together they put a root config that imports
# `tests/e2e/fixtures/` into an image that does not contain it**, and
# `next build` type-checked it and failed.
#
# Excluded here rather than from `tsconfig` deliberately: excluding it from
# the typecheck would stop `tsc --noEmit` from ever checking this file, and it
# is a file with real imports and real logic. **It is not in the image because
# nothing in the image runs it** — which is the true statement, and it leaves
# the local gate checking it exactly as before.
playwright.config.ts
playwright-report/
test-results/
